)S SYNTAX INTERPRETATION -                                              15000000
  1. USER SUPPLIED VALUES ARE IN APOSTROPHES. TWO SETS OF APOSTROPHES   16100020
     MEANS THE VALUE SHOULD BE SUPPLIED WITHIN A SET OF APOSTROPHES.    16150020
  2. WORDS WITHOUT APOSTROPHES ARE TO BE ENTERED AS SHOWN.              17150000
  3. COMMAS, PERIODS, PARENTHESES, AND ASTERISKS ARE TO BE ENTERED AS   19000020
     SHOWN.                                                             19050020
  4. EXCULSIVE CHOICES ARE INDICATED BY SLASH (/).                      19100020
  5. MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE FORMATS ARE SEPARATED BY 'OR'.                  20000000
