)F FUNCTION -                                                           34000020
  THE HELP SUBCOMMAND PROVIDES FUNCTION, SYNTAX, AND OPERAND            35000000
  INFORMATION ON THE CURRENTLY PROCESSING COMMAND AND ITS SUBCOMMANDS.  36000020
  MESSAGE IDENTIFIER INFORMATION IS SUPPLIED WHEN AVAILABLE.            36900100
)X SYNTAX -                                                             37400100
